1495
00:39:37,440 --> 00:39:40,600
See on hea näha.

1496
00:39:40,640 --> 00:39:44,480
70... 80...

1497
00:39:46,760 --> 00:39:49,560
Jah.

1498
00:39:46,760 --> 00:39:49,560
See oli seal ühtlane.

1499
00:39:49,600 --> 00:39:51,880
Jah, ma tunnen end hästi.

1500
00:39:49,600 --> 00:39:51,880
lähen seal läbi.

1501
00:39:51,920 --> 00:39:55,040
Ma sain selle neljanda käikuga.

1502
00:39:51,920 --> 00:39:55,040
just nagu jõudsin rehvidele.

1503
00:39:55,840 --> 00:39:57,360
See on kurv.

1504
00:39:57,400 --> 00:39:59,000
See on...

1505
00:39:57,400 --> 00:39:59,000
Oh, vaata, kuidas ta käitub.

1506
00:39:57,400 --> 00:39:59,000
(väriseb)

1507
00:39:59,040 --> 00:40:00,840
See on väga hea.

1508
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:03,280
See on hea šassi, jah.

1509
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:03,280
aga sa jõuad ju edasi.

1510
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:03,280
ja te teete sellest kõige parema,

1511
00:40:03,320 --> 00:40:07,240
ja see on ka täpselt nii.

1512
00:40:03,320 --> 00:40:07,240
