1591
00:42:23,440 --> 00:42:27,520
...Lääne-Aafrikast.

1592
00:42:29,240 --> 00:42:32,240
See oli see.


1593
00:42:32,280 --> 00:42:36,200
Seda kasutati.

1594
00:42:32,280 --> 00:42:36,200
kreeklased, roomlased.

1595
00:42:32,280 --> 00:42:36,200
berberid, fönikislased.

1596
00:42:36,240 --> 00:42:39,520
vandalid, araablased.

1597
00:42:36,240 --> 00:42:39,520
kartaaglastest,

1598
00:42:36,240 --> 00:42:39,520
ootmanid,

1599
00:42:39,560 --> 00:42:42,000
prantslased, tuaregid,

1600
00:42:39,560 --> 00:42:42,000
itaallased.

1601
00:42:42,560 --> 00:42:44,040
ja britid.

1602
00:42:46,320 --> 00:42:52,520
Aga siis, aastal 1968,

1603
00:42:46,320 --> 00:42:52,520
...kaamelile 4000-aastane ajalugu.

1604
00:42:46,320 --> 00:42:52,520
...monopol läks lõpuks katki.

1605
00:42:52,560 --> 00:42:54,120
(karjub)

1606
00:42:54,160 --> 00:42:56,560
...aga see muutus toimus 1968. aastal, kui Peugeot 504 seda katkestas.

1607
00:43:03,880 --> 00:43:07,080
Paljud inimesed kujutlevad...

1608
00:43:03,880 --> 00:43:07,080
See olid kas Land Rover või Jeep.

1609
00:43:07,120 --> 00:43:09,200
mis viis

1610
00:43:07,120 --> 00:43:09,200
